course: dictionary
lesson: 546
title: One word, many meanings: attack
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: The word attack can mean different things, so the context tells you which meaning you need. «The lion will attack if you get too close» means it will try to hurt you with force.
explain: In football, «The team began to attack in the second half» means the players are trying to score. The clue is the word football. The same word now means something very different from fighting.
explain: Attack can also mean saying strongly that something is wrong. «The newspaper began to attack the plan» means it criticised the plan. An asthma attack is a sudden illness, not a fight at all. Always ask: what is happening in this sentence?
fact: Attack is both a verb and a noun: you attack, or you make an attack.
fact: «Attack» means to try to hurt someone or something with force.
fact: In sport, «attack» means to try to score, and the attack is the players doing that.
fact: «An attack» can be a sudden illness, like «an asthma attack», which needs an inhaler and an adult.
fact: Vervet monkeys have different alarm calls for leopards, eagles and snakes, because each predator attacks in a different way. Leave wild animals alone.
exercise: «The thorny devil has a false head on its neck that it shows when attacked.» What does attacked mean here? | Was found in the desert | Was given a present | *Was threatened or hurt by an enemy | Was sleeping soundly
exercise: «The players began to attack in the second half.» What does attack mean in this football match? | To sing loudly | To fall asleep | To run away | *To try to score
exercise: «The newspaper began to attack the plan, saying it was unfair.» What does attack mean here? | *To say strongly that it is bad | To hug | To build | To draw
test: Vervet monkeys have different alarm calls for leopards, eagles and snakes, because each predator attacks in a different way. Why do the monkeys have different calls? | Because leopards ask them to | *Because each predator attacks in a different way | Because they like singing | Because the snakes are their friends
test: Sana says an asthma attack is a fight between two children. What is the best answer? | A game for two players | A type of cake | *A sudden bout of illness that needs an inhaler and an adult | A football match
exam: «The army will attack the castle at dawn.» What does attack mean here? | *To try to hurt something with force | To say it is bad | To try to score | To be sick
